# Themes: pick three themes from the picker. Each one applies as soon as it
# is selected. Press sends keys through tuios's own key handling, so they
# reach the palette and the picker. Type would go to the pane.
Sleep 800ms
Action command_palette
Sleep 600ms
Press "t h e m e enter"
Sleep 800ms
Press "t o k y o"
Sleep 1400ms
Press "enter"
Sleep 1000ms
Action command_palette
Sleep 400ms
Press "t h e m e enter"
Sleep 600ms
Press "g r u v"
Sleep 1400ms
Press "enter"
Sleep 1000ms
Action command_palette
Sleep 400ms
Press "t h e m e enter"
Sleep 600ms
Press "r o s e"
Sleep 1400ms
Press "enter"
Sleep 1200ms
